   {
    "type": "column",
    "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "A Perfect Day in New York",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>20. Juni 2025 | 2 min read | Till Weisbrod</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Flugbegleiter Till Weisbrod liebt es, im Big Apple unterwegs zu sein. Wer New York an einem Tag erleben will, kann ihn auf seinem Trip begleiten und seinen Empfehlungen folgen.</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Vormittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/image_copy_copy",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/lh_app_pancakes_westend61-SBDF000922_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Teller mit gestapelten Pancakes und Butter oben drauf"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Frühstück am East River</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Vor dem Frühstück mache ich einen Abstecher an den East River, um Manhattans Skyline Hallo zu sagen</li><li>Clark's Restaurant, mein liebster Frühstück-Spot, ist nur wenige Gehminuten entfernt</li><li>Das Diner serviert alle Klassiker: Pancakes, French Toast oder Rührei</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "80 Clark St",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par3/image_copy_870847809",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/lh_app_new-york_ground-zero-memorial_alamy-DD6KEW_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Ground Zero Memorial in New York"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Durch Brooklyn Heights bummeln</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Das richtige New-York-Gefühl stellt sich vor allem beim Weg über die Brooklyn Bridge ein. Vor mir liegt Manhattan. In der Ferne kann ich die Freiheitsstatue sehen</li><li>Mein Tipp: Montagmorgens gibt es auf der Website des National September 11 Memorial and Museum ab 7 Uhr Gratis-Tickets für denselben Tag</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "180 Greenwich St",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par6/separator_copy_copy_"
